{"id": "P000791", "generatable": true, "realistic": true, "tamper_ok": true, "defects": ["Tamper cue is placed in a slot that doesn't exist on this carrier: 「另在背面条形码上方小字重复标示批准文号「食健备G202434007358」」, but the carrier is a single-sided pharmacy poster, and no back side or barcode is described anywhere. The model has to invent a barcode area or may drop the second number, which would remove the anomaly."], "severity": "minor"}
{"id": "P001856", "generatable": true, "realistic": true, "tamper_ok": true, "defects": ["Per-tablet mass doesn't add up: 1.0g tablet with 蛋白质0.1g+脂肪0.1g+碳水0.7g plus 钙102mg (≈255mg 碳酸钙) ≈1.15g > 1.0g (pedantic)."], "severity": "minor"}
{"id": "P001173", "generatable": true, "realistic": true, "tamper_ok": true, "defects": ["Generic preparation copy mentions a container this product doesn't have: 「杯装撕开杯盖、袋装倒入碗中」, but the product is 35g×14袋 sachets only.", "「—反式脂肪｜0.8 g」 per 100g is high, though plausible with 氢化植物油 (cosmetic)."], "severity": "minor"}
