{"id": "P002898", "generatable": true, "realistic": true, "tamper_ok": true, "defects": ["Price copy is arithmetically incoherent beyond the intended anomaly: 「¥2.90为第3件加购价，需同时购买2件原价商品，单件实付最低¥8.90」. Two items at ¥8.90 plus one at ¥2.90 averages ¥6.90, so 'lowest per-item ¥8.90' makes no sense. A third, unexplained activity price 「按活动价¥6.20结算」 also sits in the rules and never appears in the price block. The hidden-condition anomaly is still present."], "severity": "minor"}
